{"id":"665357362de6e2b3d48068fa9f2ab8a636772f02","axis":"silent","repo":"vllm-project/vllm","sha":"665357362de6e2b3d48068fa9f2ab8a636772f02","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/features/speculative_decoding/README.md","lines":["@@ -138,6 +138,7 @@ only apply to model-based methods such as `draft_model`, `mtp`, `eagle3`, and"," | `model` | `string` | `None` | Draft model, EAGLE head, or auxiliary model identifier. For `ngram`, `ngram_gpu`, `suffix`, and `mtp`, this can often be omitted. |"," | `num_speculative_tokens` | `integer > 0` | `None` | Number of speculative tokens to propose per step. Required for methods that do not infer it from model metadata. |"," | `draft_tensor_parallel_size` | `integer >= 1` | `None` | Tensor parallel size for the draft model. |","+| `draft_decode_context_parallel_size` | `integer >= 1` | `None` | Decode context parallel size for the draft model: `1` or the target's `decode_context_parallel_size`. Defaults to the target's, except `dflash`/`dspark` drafts, which default to `1` unless they are full-attention MLA. |"," | `max_model_len` | `integer >= 1` | `None` | Maximum context length for the draft model. A draft limit below the target's may also lower the engine's `max_model_len`. |"," | `parallel_drafting` | `boolean` | `null` | Deprecated and has no effect. `dflash` and `dspark` always draft in parallel, and no other method supports it. |"," | `rejection_sample_method` | `string` | `standard` | `standard`, `synthetic`, `block`, or the lossy `fly` verifier. |"],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/test_config.py","lines":["@@ -2135,6 +2135,31 @@ def test_draft_parallel_config_preserves_ep_without_model(","     assert target_parallel_config.enable_expert_parallel is target_ep"," "," ","+@pytest.mark.skip_global_cleanup","+@pytest.mark.parametrize(","+    (\"configured\", \"expected\"),","+    [(None, 4), (1, 1), (4, 4), (2, ValueError)],","+)","+def test_draft_decode_context_parallel_size(configured, expected):",